# pond is a local-first desktop app. Runtime secrets (ingest token) are
# stored in the macOS Keychain / Windows Credential Manager by the desktop
# app itself, so there's no `.env` for the app at runtime. This file only
# documents the optional development toggles read by the desktop app and
# its build scripts.

# Open the renderer devtools on launch.
# POND_OPEN_DEVTOOLS="1"
# POND_DEVTOOLS="1"

# Dump raw Cosmos scrape captures to disk for debugging.
# POND_DUMP_COSMOS_CAPTURES="1"
